{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../add_profile_audio/", "title": "add_profile_audio()"}, "next": {"link": "../set_profile_audio_position/", "title": "set_profile_audio_position()"}, "title": "remove_profile_audio()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"remove-profile-audio\">\n<h1>remove_profile_audio()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#remove-profile-audio\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.remove_profile_audio\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">remove_profile_audio</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.remove_profile_audio\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Removes an audio file from the profile audio files of the current user.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>audio</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Identifier of the audio file to be removed.\nUse <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../get_chat_audios/#pyrogram.Client.get_chat_audios\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.get_chat_audios\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_chat_audios()</span></code></a> to get the Audio identifier.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code> \u2013 On success, True is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"c1\"># Remove audio file from profile</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">remove_profile_audio</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/set_profile_audio_position", "set_profile_audio_position()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/add_profile_audio", "add_profile_audio()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">remove_profile_audio()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.remove_profile_audio\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.remove_profile_audio()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/remove_profile_audio", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}